capability regex/search-until  a search that reads the text only up to a position
  heroes  built-in slice
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  Pattern.search (endpos), Pattern.match (endpos), Pattern.fullmatch (endpos), Match.endpos
  note    Python's `endpos` reads the text as if it ended there, which a slice from 0 is, its positions unchanged

