capability regex/search-all  every match, none overlapping another
  heroes  regex.search_all
  go      Regexp.FindAll, Regexp.FindAllIndex, Regexp.FindAllString, Regexp.FindAllStringIndex, Regexp.FindAllSubmatch, Regexp.FindAllSubmatchIndex, Regexp.FindAllStringSubmatch, Regexp.FindAllStringSubmatchIndex
  rust    -
  python  re.findall, re.finditer, Pattern.findall, Pattern.finditer
  note    empty matches by Python's rule (Perl's too): `a*` in "baaa" answers "", "aaa" and "", where Go drops an empty match just after another

